---
import { getCollection } from "astro:content";
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "@/components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "@/components/Footer.astro";
import Socials from "@/components/Socials.astro";
import LinkButton from "@/components/LinkButton.astro";
import Card from "@/components/Card.astro";
import getSortedPosts from "@/utils/getSortedPosts";
import IconRss from "@/assets/icons/IconRss.svg";
import IconArrowRight from "@/assets/icons/IconArrowRight.svg";
import { SITE } from "@/config";
import { SOCIALS } from "@/constants";

const [blogPosts, galleryPosts] = await Promise.all([
  getCollection("blog"),
  SITE.showGalleries && SITE.showGalleriesInIndex
    ? getCollection("galleries")
    : Promise.resolve([]),
]);
const posts = [...blogPosts, ...galleryPosts];

const sortedPosts = getSortedPosts(posts);
const featuredPosts = sortedPosts.filter(({ data }) => "featured" in data && data.featured);
const recentPosts = sortedPosts.filter(({ data }) => !("featured" in data && data.featured));
---

<Layout title="Lead Generation Systems Resource Hub" description="Organize the core resources, subtopics, and implementation paths for lead generation systems in Berlin. Key entities: Lead Generation Systems.">
  <Header />

  <main id="main-content" data-layout="index" class="relative app-layout">
    <section class="content-pack-homepage space-y-10">
      <header class="max-w-3xl space-y-4">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-accent">Featured resource</p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold leading-tight md:text-5xl text-foreground">Lead Generation Systems Resource Hub</h1>
        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-foreground/75">Organize the core resources, subtopics, and implementation paths for lead generation systems in Berlin. Key entities: Lead Generation Systems.</p>
      </header>
      <nav class="space-y-3" aria-label="Table of contents">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">Table of contents</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-foreground/75">
          <li><a href="#what-this-resource-hub-covers">What this resource hub covers</a></li>
          <li><a href="#featured-pillar-guide">Featured pillar guide</a></li>
          <li><a href="#topic-cards-and-supporting-paths">Topic cards and supporting paths</a></li>
          <li><a href="#benchmark-or-methodology-highlights">Benchmark or methodology highlights</a></li>
          <li><a href="#faq-and-glossary-references">FAQ and glossary references</a></li>
          <li><a href="#next-actions">Next actions</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
      <div class="grid gap-8">
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 id="what-this-resource-hub-covers" class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">What this resource hub covers</h2>
          <p class="text-foreground/75">The Lead Generation Systems Resource Hub in Berlin is your comprehensive guide to understanding and implementing effective lead generation systems. This hub covers a wide range of topics, including the fundamentals of lead generation, best practices, common mistakes, and real-life case studies. It also provides a detailed checklist and methodology to help you get started.</p>
        </section>
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 id="featured-pillar-guide" class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">Featured pillar guide</h2>
          <p class="text-foreground/75">Our featured pillar guide, &#39;The Ultimate Guide to Lead Generation Systems&#39;, takes you through the entire process of setting up and managing lead generation systems. It covers everything from understanding your target audience to creating effective lead magnets and nurturing leads until they&#39;re ready to convert.</p>
        </section>
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 id="topic-cards-and-supporting-paths" class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">Topic cards and supporting paths</h2>
          <p class="text-foreground/75">Explore our topic cards to delve deeper into specific aspects of lead generation systems. Each card offers supporting paths or related resources to help you gain a well-rounded understanding of the subject. Topics range from workflow optimization to lead scoring and lead qualification.</p>
        </section>
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 id="benchmark-or-methodology-highlights" class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">Benchmark or methodology highlights</h2>
          <p class="text-foreground/75">The resource hub highlights key benchmarks and methodologies used in lead generation systems. For instance, you&#39;ll learn about the BANT framework for qualifying leads and the lead scoring model to prioritize your sales efforts. These insights help you understand what&#39;s working for others and how you can adapt these strategies for your business.</p>
        </section>
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 id="faq-and-glossary-references" class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">FAQ and glossary references</h2>
          <p class="text-foreground/75">For quick answers to your questions, refer to our FAQ page. It covers common queries about lead generation systems, from definitions to best practices. Additionally, our glossary provides clear explanations of key terms to ensure you&#39;re always on the same page as your team and other stakeholders.</p>
        </section>
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 id="next-actions" class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">Next actions</h2>
          <p class="text-foreground/75">Now that you&#39;ve explored the Lead Generation Systems Resource Hub, it&#39;s time to take action. Start by identifying the areas where your current lead generation systems could use improvement. Then, dive into the relevant guides, case studies, and checklists to make data-driven decisions and optimize your processes. Finally, track your progress using the suggested metrics to ensure continuous improvement.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">Related links</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-foreground/75">
